        { "id": "aspect-ratio-shapes", "title": "Shapes", "lead": "The ratio is the box's shape, as width over height. To change it from 16:9, the default, set `Ratio`. Here the same picture shows at 16:9, 1:1 and 4:5, cropped to fill each." },
        { "id": "aspect-ratio-thumbnails", "title": "Matching thumbnails", "lead": "Thumbnails with the same shape keep a grid's rows lined up. Give each one the same `Ratio`, and pictures of any shape, here a wide one and a tall one, crop to it. Other content fills the box too, such as a `Center` with an icon where there's no picture." }
      ]
