        { "id": "qr-code-two-factor", "title": "Setting up two-factor sign-in", "lead": "An authenticator app scans an `otpauth://` link and shows a new code every 30 seconds. Show the key beside the code for typing in, and a `PinField` for the code the app shows. Scan it with any authenticator app to try it.",
